Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0300
Subject: metaedit: share the commit edit transaction

Separate revision selection from metadata mutation and extract the transaction-backed editing path behind a dedicated options type. Sibling commands can now reuse descendant transformation and rewrite bookkeeping without constructing metaedit's command-line arguments.

